# ChimeraX Script: S348T Local Energy Minimization
# Targeting Transmembrane Helix 6 (TM6) residues 340-360

# 1. Preparation: Add Hydrogens and Charges
addh
addcharge

# 2. Select the Region of Interest
select :340-360

# 3. Define the Constraints
# Freeze the rest of the protein to maintain global structural integrity
freeze ~:340-360

# 4. Energy Minimization (Steepest Descent + Conjugate Gradient)
# 100 iterations of each to remove major clashes and refine side-chains
minimize nsteps 100 cgsteps 100 stepsize 0.02 interval 10

# 5. Post-Minimization Analysis
# Calculate local RMSD to quantify structural relaxation
select :348
measure rmsd #1:340-360 to_structure #1:340-360

# 6. Hydrogen Bond Analysis
# Verify if the 102 structural H-bonds are preserved
hbonds :340-360 intramodel true reveal true
